    <briefdescription>
<para>Wrapper to model the analysis pass concept. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Can wrap any type which implements a suitable <computeroutput>run</computeroutput> method. The method must accept an <computeroutput>IRUnitT&amp;</computeroutput> and an <computeroutput><ref refid="classllvm_1_1_analysis_manager" kindref="compound">AnalysisManager&lt;IRUnitT&gt;</ref>&amp;</computeroutput> as arguments and produce an object which can be wrapped in a <computeroutput><ref refid="structllvm_1_1detail_1_1_analysis_result_model" kindref="compound">AnalysisResultModel</ref></computeroutput>. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
